WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.769
-Welcome back. I'm hanging
with Robert De Niro here.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.670
Now, a lot of people
don't know this,

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.907
but we actually
did a movie together.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.808
Remember that?

00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:11.210
-No, I don't remember.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:12.544
-Come on. It was based on

00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:16.182
the international best selling
novel, "Space Train."

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.386
It was huge. You got to remember
"Space Train," right?

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:20.986
No. Okay.

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:24.524
I have -- I have a clip of it.
Can we -- Can we roll the clip?

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.028 line:0%
-In the not-too-distant future,

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:32.065 line:0%
a select group of the finest
astronauts humanity has to offer

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:35.601 line:0%
will be called upon to save
the Earth from cosmic danger.

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:39.638 line:0%
It just so happens
that they're all afraid to fly.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:42.408 line:0%
But for those brave souls,
there is hope.

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:46.312
There is destiny. There is...

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.182
space train!

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:56.256
-All aboard.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.389
-Here's my ticket, alright,

00:00:57.389 --> 00:00:58.891
but let me tell you
something, alright?

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:01.494
I ain't going to space,
'cause I don't fly, okay?

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:05.298
I would if I could,
but I can't, so I won't.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.032
-Shut your mouth!

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:11.170
This train's about to blast off,
and it's only got one stop.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.573
Outer space.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:22.514 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:22.514 --> 00:01:25.185
-"Space Train"!

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.391
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:40.065
-I think it, uh --
I think it still holds up.

00:01:40.065 --> 00:01:41.601
-Yeah, now I remember.

